{"type":"item.completed","item":{"id":"item_3","type":"command_execution","command":"\"C:\\\\Users\\\\chuanle song\\\\AppData\\\\Local\\\\Microsoft\\\\WindowsApps\\\\pwsh.exe\" -Command \"Get-Content -Raw 'pipeline/codex_memory.md'\"","aggregated_output":"# AdaRES_project Research Memory\n\n## Goal And Phase\n- Phase 1 ScanRefer mIoU >= 0.515 unmet; Phase 2 pending. Server-2 GPUs 0/1 only, one task per GPU; server-6 excluded.\n- Released SPFormer sparse-UNet backbone and project decoder. No validation tuning of thresholds, temperatures, weights, feature sets or fixed 30-epoch protocol.\n- `research_on_capacity_gap=true`; admission hard gates: diagnosis, controls, native backward, resources, independence and goal constraints.\n\n## Champion And Baseline\n- B1 0.5020 mIoU, Acc@0.25 0.610, Acc@0.5 0.553, spmIoU 0.467.\n- B4-E30 champion 0.5094, Acc@0.25 0.608, Acc@0.5 0.562, spmIoU 0.474 at epoch 27; target gap 0.0056. It continued epoch-20 optimizer/scheduler, not a fresh matched control.\n- B4-E30 best checkpoint: `/bak_home/songcl/Project/AdaRES_project/AdaRES_checkpoints/adares_b4_query_competition_res/20260921_210214/best.pth`.\n\n## Active Hypotheses\n- G1 changes seed/object indicator labels to detached per-query predicted-mask IoU against training targets. Fixed 16-scene B4 diagnosis: 37/240 material errors selected a positive lower-IoU query over a seed-negative oracle. Native backward/resource gates passed; terminal outcome awaits scheduled monitor.\n- No other candidate passes admission. Fixed-subset oracle-mask quality greatly exceeds selected-mask quality, but that does not establish a successful confidence mechanism.\n\n## Closed Or Failed Directions\n- B0 0.333; B2-E30 0.5058; B3 0.5014; B4 20-epoch 0.5070; B5 0.5030; C1-E30 0.5008; C2-E30 0.5014; F4 0.5060; D1 0.5080. No tuning-only, seed-repeat or extension-only successor.\n- H5 late global query attention stopped at best 0.5061 after 30 validations, below B4-E30. Not all final training steps completed; auxiliary terminal metrics unavailable.\n- E1 stability, F1 entropy, F2 compactness, F3 seed proximity rejected. H1 sampler omission, H2 shortlist coverage, H3 standalone score, H4 relation cohort rejected.\n- J1 pooled mask-language contrast 123/240 directional, standalone subset mIoU 0.01315; J2 overlap crowding 78/240. K1 sampler rank 141/240, sampler-only 0.34587; K2 area 118/240, largest-mask 0.27271. All rejected.\n- L1 mask-interior coherence 116/240, standalone 0.13079; L2 local boundary contrast 104/240, standalone 0.25651. Both rejected at diagnosis.\n- M1 seed containment oracle higher 48/240, standalone 0.43714; M2 projected-2D mask-seed appearance oracle higher 80/240, standalone 0.11752. B4 fixed subset 0.49186; both rejected at diagnosis, no training admission.\n\n## Running And Queue\n- Prepared 2026-09-26 16:47 +08:00 monitor: G1 marked running server-2 GPU0 with deathwatch 2/3; active 1/2, no waiting/claiming, candidate budget one.\n- One targeted live log showed G1 Val[30/30] mIoU 0.497, Acc@0.5 0.542, Acc@0.25 0.602, spmIoU 0.465 and last checkpoint. This is last validation, not best metric or a monitor-certified terminal state. Do not manually mutate queue.\n- G1 commit `0f5f695d478b87750d69561428f6421833e629a9`, admission receipt and native launch progress recorded. GPU1 unassigned; no new candidate enqueued or synced.\n- `research_work.json` design cycle attempted M1/M2, admitted zero, preserves hashed evidence and resume condition. No due pending candidate.\n\n## Open Questions And Risks\n- No pending questions in prepared manifest. G1 reconciled terminal status/best, active queries, latency, full-run peak memory, subgroup effects and evaluation noise remain unknown.\n- Local Python lacks PyTorch; M1/M2 ran in native server-2 environment on GPU1 as read-only research scripts in `/tmp`. M2 hook index was corrected and rerun; no candidate code sync or dispatch.\n- Fixed 16-scene screens are observational, not population or causal efficacy estimates. Negative routes do not establish global hypothesis exhaustion. Resume on G1 reconciliation or independent evidence with a concrete native test.\n\n## Last Tick\n- 2026-09-26 17:03 +08:00 design: prepared monitor and goal preflight succeeded once, not rerun. M1/M2 native screens rejected; analysis, motivation review, design, route decision and SHA256 evidence recorded. G1 log reached last validation but queue remains for scheduled reconciliation.\n\r\n","exit_code":0,"status":"completed"}}
