{"type":"item.completed","item":{"id":"item_7","type":"command_execution","command":"\"C:\\\\Users\\\\chuanle song\\\\AppData\\\\Local\\\\Microsoft\\\\WindowsApps\\\\pwsh.exe\" -Command \"Get-Content -Raw 'pipeline/experiments/AdaRES-G1.json'; Get-Content -Raw 'pipeline/analyses/AdaRES-M1-M2_negative_diagnosis_20260926-165700.md'; Get-Content -Raw 'pipeline/designs/exp_design_20260926-165700.md'; Get-Content -Raw 'pipeline/decisions/20260926-170348_route_change.md'\"","aggregated_output":"{\r\n  \"id\": \"AdaRES-G1\",\r\n  \"config\": \"configs_song/model_paper5/adares_g1_metric_targets_res.yaml\",\r\n  \"server\": \"server-2\",\r\n  \"gpu\": \"0\",\r\n  \"status\": \"done_complete\",\r\n  \"history\": [\r\n    {\r\n      \"ts\": \"2026-09-25T17:08:09.040569\",\r\n      \"action\": \"launched\",\r\n      \"gpu\": \"0\"\r\n    },\r\n    {\r\n      \"ts\": \"2026-09-26T17:47:13.234330\",\r\n      \"status\": \"done_complete\",\r\n      \"best_miou\": \"0.4980\",\r\n      \"epochs\": \"30/30\"\r\n    }\r\n  ],\r\n  \"launched\": \"2026-09-25T17:08:09\",\r\n  \"final_best\": \"0.4980\",\r\n  \"finished_at\": \"2026-09-26T17:47:13\",\r\n  \"log_local\": \"\",\r\n  \"epochs_final\": \"30/30\"\r\n}\r\n# Fixed native screens: seed containment and 2D appearance support\n\n2026-09-26 16:57 Asia/Shanghai. B4-E30 best checkpoint, first 16 ScanRefer validation scenes, 441 expressions, 240 material selection errors (oracle minus selected mask IoU > 0.05). Read-only server-2 GPU1 inference. Raw paired rows: `AdaRES-M1_native_16scenes_20260926.json` and `AdaRES-M2_native_16scenes_20260926.json`.\n\n| Route | Predeclared mechanism | Paired evidence and standalone control | Decision |\n|---|---|---|---|\n| M1 seed containment | A query whose mask retains its own sampled seed should be more credible than a displaced query. This tests mask membership, not F3's distance to seed or G1's target label. | Oracle support higher in 48/240 material errors. Mean selected 0.97223 versus oracle 0.61828. Support-only mIoU 0.43714 versus B4 indicator 0.49186. | Reject directional mechanism. No threshold or fusion scan. |\n| M2 2D appearance support | The predicted mask's pooled projected 2D appearance should agree with its own sampled seed appearance, supplying information beyond the 3D decoder coherence of L1. | Oracle support higher in 80/240. Mean selected 0.95035 versus oracle 0.91840. Support-only mIoU 0.11752 versus B4 0.49186. | Reject directional mechanism. No feature or fusion scan. |\n\nThe M2 diagnostic hook initially used decoder input index 7 and raised `IndexError`; corrected to index 6, then reran the unchanged test successfully. Python syntax checks passed. The tests use already fused model features and are observational fixed-subset diagnostics, not population efficacy estimates. Both routes fail the diagnosis hard gate. No candidate-specific backward, resource profile, independent model package, admission receipt, or dispatch is claimed.\n\nOne targeted G1 live-log check reached Val[30/30] and printed mIoU 0.497, Acc@0.5 0.542, Acc@0.25 0.602, spmIoU 0.465 and a last checkpoint. The prepared queue remains running with deathwatch 2/3; terminal reconciliation and best metric belong to the next scheduled monitor.\n\r\n# Experiment Design - AdaRES_project\n\n2026-09-26 16:57 Asia/Shanghai\n\n## 1. Motivation\nGoal: \"AdaRES: improve a faithful standard-indicator 3D referring expression segmentation baseline by learning query confidence from metric-aligned evidence, targeting ScanRefer mIoU >= 0.515.\" Prepared active 1/2, candidate budget one. M1/M2 tested independent potential evidence paths for confidence before any training admission.\n\n## 2. Current Best Results\n| ID | State | mIoU | Acc@0.25 | Acc@0.5 | spmIoU |\n|---|---|---:|---:|---:|---:|\n| B1 | complete | 0.5020 | 0.610 | 0.553 | 0.467 |\n| B4-E30 | champion | 0.5094 | 0.608 | 0.562 | 0.474 |\n| H5 | early stop | 0.5061 | unavailable | unavailable | unavailable |\n| G1 | queue running, process absent | not terminal | unavailable | unavailable | unavailable |\n\n## 3. Analysis & Direction\nFixed B4 16-scene subset has 441 expressions and 240 material errors. M1 oracle seed containment higher in 48/240, support-only mIoU 0.43714; M2 oracle 2D mask-seed appearance support higher in 80/240, appearance-only mIoU 0.11752. B4 subset mIoU 0.49186. Neither proposed signal supports its directional mechanism. G1 log reached its last validation, but monitor reconciliation remains outstanding.\n\n## 4. Experiment Plan\nNo training candidate admitted. M1 and M2 fail diagnosis. The candidate budget is a maximum, not an instruction to admit a weak or duplicate variant. Their controls ran natively, but backward, resources, independent model implementation and receipt are not asserted.\n\n## 5. GPU Allocation Plan\nOnly server-2 GPUs 0/1 are eligible. Prepared G1 remains assigned GPU0 under deathwatch 2/3; GPU1 was used transiently for read-only native tests and remains unassigned. Server-6 excluded. Normal monitor owns G1 reconciliation; no manual queue mutation or launch.\n\n## 6. Implementation Checklist\n- [x] Predeclare and run fixed-cohort M1/M2 paired native diagnoses and standalone controls.\n- [x] Verify diagnostic syntax, preserve raw rows and record disconfirming evidence.\n- [ ] Do not create model/config, commit candidate, sync, receipt or dispatch until a newly evidenced candidate passes diagnosis, controls, native backward, resources, independence and all goal constraints.\n- [ ] Let scheduled monitor reconcile G1 and compare its terminal best result to B4-E30.\n\n## 7. Risk Assessment\nSmall fixed validation cohort is observational, not an estimate of population benefit. M2's projected 2D features are already fused by the decoder, so they are not an independent visual oracle. G1 may change the error profile. The initial M2 hook indexing failure was corrected and the unchanged test completed.\n\n## 8. Smell Check\nNo validation search over feature definitions, score weights, thresholds or training protocol. A fusion coefficient or renamed support head would be tuning without a supported causal diagnosis.\n\nStatus: NO ADMISSION. This cycle tested two distinct executable directions and stopped after both were disconfirmed; global route exhaustion is not claimed. Resume on reconciled G1 outcome plus a concrete new error mechanism, or independent prospective evidence and native next action.\n\r\n# AdaRES_project 决策记录\n\n- **时间**: 2026-09-26 17:03:47\n- **类型**: route_change\n- **问题**: Do seed containment or projected-2D appearance support justify one new training admission?\n- **决策**: Reject M1 and M2 after native fixed-cohort diagnoses; leave server-2 GPU1 vacant and allow scheduled monitor to reconcile G1.\n- **依据**: M1 oracle higher 48/240, selector mIoU 0.43714; M2 oracle higher 80/240, selector 0.11752 versus B4 subset 0.49186. Both fail diagnosis.\n- **证据**: pipeline/analyses/AdaRES-M1-M2_negative_diagnosis_20260926-165700.md; pipeline/research_work.json\n\r\n","exit_code":0,"status":"completed"}}
